<h2 class="bde-heading-506-115 bde-heading">
What Is Jabari Smith Jr.’s 2026-27 Salary?
</h2><div class="bde-fancy-container-506-116 bde-fancy-container">
  
  
	



<div class="bde-fancy-container-506-139 bde-fancy-container">
  
  
	



<div class="bde-f-text-506-151 bde-f-text">
<p>Smith earns <strong>$23.64m</strong> in 2026-27, fourth on the <a href="/teams/houston-rockets/">Houston</a> payroll and the first year of his extension. It is almost double the <strong>$12.35m</strong> he was paid last season.</p>
<p>His career earnings come to <strong>$63.97m</strong> across five seasons, all at Houston. The salary is <strong>11.80%</strong> of the club’s <strong>$200.41m</strong> payroll.</p>

