<h3>What’s Next for Jabari Smith Jr. Beyond 2026?</h3><p>Four seasons remain after this one, worth about <strong>$98.36m</strong> and all fully guaranteed. He reaches unrestricted free agency in the summer of 2031 at 28, which is the age at which a forward signs his largest contract.</p><script src="/_ported/8334868131c3.js" is:inline></script>
