<h2>How Much Does Jabari Smith Jr. Earn Over Time?</h2><p>A <strong>$23.64m</strong> season is hard to picture, so here's what it comes to over smaller stretches of time.</p><div class="nf-time"><div class="nf-stat"><div class="nf-label">Per Month</div><div class="nf-value">$1,970,284</div></div><div class="nf-stat"><div class="nf-label">Per Week</div><div class="nf-value">$454,681</div></div><div class="nf-stat"><div class="nf-label">Per Day</div><div class="nf-value">$64,776</div></div><div class="nf-stat"><div class="nf-label">Per Hour</div><div class="nf-value">$2,699</div></div><div class="nf-stat"><div class="nf-label">Per Minute</div><div class="nf-value">$45</div></div></div><script src="/_ported/8334868131c3.js" is:inline></script>
