<h2 class="bde-heading-506-117 bde-heading">
What Is Jabari Smith Jr.’s Contract With the Rockets?
</h2><div class="bde-fancy-container-506-118 bde-fancy-container">
  
  
	



<div class="bde-fancy-container-506-141 bde-fancy-container">
  
  
	



<div class="bde-f-text-506-154 bde-f-text">
<p>Smith signed a rookie extension on July 6, 2025, five years and <strong>$122m</strong> with every dollar guaranteed and no options at either end.</p>
<p>It takes effect this season and runs to 2030-31, when he will be 27. Third overall in 2022 carries a large rookie contract on its own, and this deal is worth three times that again.</p>

</div><div class="bde-shortcode-506-191 bde-shortcode"><div class="nba-fin" data-nba-fin="proportions">
