</div><div class="bde-f-text-506-156 bde-f-text">
<p>Smith’s net worth is estimated at around <strong>$25.6m</strong>, derived from his <strong>$63.97m</strong> in career earnings. No outlet publishes a figure for him.</p>
<p>He played one season at Auburn and was 19 when Houston drafted him third in 2022. His father played four seasons in the league.</p>

